          "text": "Containers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'll analyze the implications of introducing WebContainers specifically for this GSAP Studio project."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on this GSAP animation editor architecture, here's a detailed analysis of introducing WebContainers (StackBlitz's browser-based Node.js runtime):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What WebContainers Enable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Core Capability:** Run a full Node.js environment (npm, build tools, dev servers) entirely in the browser using WebAssembly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Potential Use Cases for This Project"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
